      "doc": "Re-point the SAC's admin to `new_sac_admin`.\\n\\n**DANGER**: This is the single most dangerous function in the contract.\\nOnce called, this contract loses SAC admin rights. The new admin has\\nfull control of the BRLP asset (authorize, clawback, mint, set_admin).\\n\\n**Future work**: This function is the primary candidate for a timelock\\nand/or requiring the `Admin` role holder to be a multisig account.\\nUntil then, operational discipline MUST ensure the `Admin` holder is a\\nclassic multisig with an appropriate threshold.",
